  "lines_iast": [
   "kṛtāni veśmāni ca pāṇḍurāṇi̭ tathā supuṣpā api puṣkariṇyaḥ",
   "punaśca padmāni sakesarāṇi̭ dhanyāni citrāṇi tathā vanāni"
