   "अपश्यतोऽभवदतिदुःखितं मनः॑ सुचक्षुषः प्रविचरतो महात्मनः"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "tatastadā bahuvidhabhāvitātmana̭ḥ kṛtātmano janakasutāṃ suvartmanaḥ",
   "apaśyato'bhavadatiduḥkhitaṃ mana̭ḥ sucakṣuṣaḥ pravicarato mahātmanaḥ"
  ],
